      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6.  Now if we want to use ' import ' than in package.json we need\nto add  \"type\": \"module\"\n\n7.  insatall nodemon with dev dependencies so it does not affect\nwhile deploying :-  \" npm i -D nodemon \"\n\n8. Change the starter script ' \"dev\": \"nodemon src/index.js\" '\n\n9. install prettier to fix the the code writting type, install by\nusing :- ' npm i -D prettier '\n\n10. After install prettier add file ' .prettierrc ' to define some\ncontex :-\n\n           {\n    \"singleQuote\": false,\n    \"bracketSpacing\": true,\n    \"tabWidth\": 2,\n    \"trailingComma\": \"es5\",\n    \"semi\": true\n}\n\n\nand make ' .prettierignore ' file to ignore some file because they\nthere define syntax so prettier does not touch it \n;-  \n   /.vscode\n/node_modules\n./dist\n\n*.env\n.env\n.env.\n\n11.  ' npm i dotenv ' to use .env file\n\n12. ' npm i mongoose '\n\n13.  ' npm i express '",
      "fontSize": 22.494562337090457,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6.  Now if we want to use ' import ' than in package.json we need to add  \"type\": \"module\"\n\n7.  insatall nodemon with dev dependencies so it does not affect while deploying :-  \" npm i -D nodemon \"\n\n8. Change the starter script ' \"dev\": \"nodemon src/index.js\" '\n\n9. install prettier to fix the the code writting type, install by using :- ' npm i -D prettier '\n\n10. After install prettier add file ' .prettierrc ' to define some contex :-\n\n           {\n    \"singleQuote\": false,\n    \"bracketSpacing\": true,\n    \"tabWidth\": 2,\n    \"trailingComma\": \"es5\",\n    \"semi\": true\n}\n\n\nand make ' .prettierignore ' file to ignore some file because they there define syntax so prettier does not touch it \n;-  \n   /.vscode\n/node_modules\n./dist\n\n*.env\n.env\n.env.\n\n11.  ' npm i dotenv ' to use .env file\n\n12. ' npm i mongoose '\n\n13.  ' npm i express '",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
